("SCCs / EU-US Data Privacy Framework", "EU", "International transfer mechanisms", "Standard contractual clauses (Decision (EU) 2021/914) and the 2023 adequacy decision for certified US companies, the routes for personal data leaving the EU.", ["privacy-and-customer-data"]),
